  "description": "Vali-Holiday is a comprehensive .NET library providing official public holiday data for 35+ countries across Latin America and Europe. Supports multilingual holiday names (es, en, pt, fr, de), Easter-based movable holidays, regional holidays, and an extensible IHolidayProvider interface for custom implementations.",
