  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Vali-Holiday v1.1.0 — add GetObservedHoliday (weekend-shift compensation for USA/UK), IsHoliday/IsHolidayInAll multi-country overloads, HolidayInfo.TryToDateTime. HolidayInfo is now a record (structural equality). Add net10.0 target. No breaking changes.\n\n            Vali-Holiday v1.0.0 — initial release with providers for 35+ countries, multilingual names, Easter calculation (Gaussian algorithm), movable holidays, O(1) HashSet cache, and HolidayProviderFactory.",
